          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 or 2 creatures",
          "save": "Basic reflex",
          "description": "<p>An arc of lightning leaps from one target to another. Each target takes 2d4 electricity damage with a basic Reflex save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "UOLbfPsF1lyGr8I5"
        },
        {
          "name": "Guidance",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 0,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "1",
          "duration": "until the start of your next turn",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You ask for the guidance of supernatural entities, granting the target a +1 status bonus to one attack roll, Perception check, saving throw, or skill check the target attempts before the duration ends. The target chooses which roll to use the bonus on before rolling. If the target uses the bonus, the spell ends. Either way, the target is then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "njiN3dJmMFGCdhLj"
        },
        {
          "name": "Know the Way",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 0,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "detection",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>In your mind's eye, you magically reorient yourself. You immediately know which direction is north (if it exists at your current location), and you can choose a location you were at within the last 24 hours and learn what direction it lies.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can choose a location you were at within the last week.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can choose a location you were at regardless of how long ago you were there.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "dOwtgYcCbvCX3SMK"
        },
        {
          "name": "Stabilize",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 0,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "healing",
            "manipulate",
            "vitality"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 dying creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>Life energy shuts death's door. The target loses the Dying condition, though it remains Unconscious at 0 Hit Points.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "6Wp8RMCa46cQuyft"
        }
